Hi everyone,

I would like to announce a field test release of a new free Alpha
emulator - AlphaVM-free.  This emulator is made to replace full Alpha
systems. You are free to use it for hobbyist or commercial purposes.
It has no expiration dates, the registration is not needed.

This emulator currently runs on 32 and 64 bit incarnations of Windows
7; the 64-bit Windows is preferred. Please visit http://emuvm.com for
more information and downloads.

In the near future we are planning to come up with a commercial
version, which will among other improvements have better performance.

Artem Alimarin


